### Create a session
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Demo session" }

> {% client.global.set("sessionId", response.body.id); %}

### Send a message
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Say hello in exactly three words." }

### Send a follow-up that depends on the history
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "How many words were in your previous answer?" }

### Read the full history and accumulated cost
GET http://localhost:3000/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### Reset the context — same session id, clean history, cost restarts at zero
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/{{sessionId}}/reset

### Read the session after reset — messages empty, totals zero, lifetime intact
GET http://localhost:3000/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### Send a message with an explicit model
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "Which model are you?", "model": "gpt-5-mini" }

### An unsupported model is rejected with the list of supported ones
POST http://localhost:3000/sessions/{{sessionId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "hi", "model": "gpt-9-imaginary" }
